# Wandertale Mentor: whenever its controller expends 4 (CR 700.14), a +1/+1 counter on it. On turn one Black Lotus pays for
# the Mentor (two mana) and Grizzly Bears (two more, the fourth): one counter. A third spell that turn spends a fifth and
# sixth mana, expending 4 no second time. On turn three the Mentor taps for green (its mana ability), which with a Forest
# casts another Grizzly Bears: two mana that turn, no expend.

